id: SCA-059
title: GitHub Actions cache poisoning risk
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: presence
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: actions/cache
patterns:
  - regex: actions/cache
    message: Actions cache is shared across workflow runs. A fork PR workflow can poison the cache and the poisoned cache affects subsequent runs with secrets.
fix: Use unique cache keys that include the PR number. Consider actions/cache/restore (read-only) for PR workflows. Never share cache between fork PRs and trusted workflows.
